                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "A cross sectional analysis of 1039 adults presenting with at least one cardio-metabolic risk factor of MASLD. All participants underwent liver assessment with VCTE. Glucose, lipid and sugar biomarkers as well as liver functions were tested. Anthropometrics, demographics, medical history, current medication, lifestyle and dietary habits were assessed and recorded."
                },
